        <part>
            33 9F A4 17 00 FF 00 02 00 02 00 01 11 11 00 00
            00 00 4C 2C 00 3C 44 00
            00 00 4C 66 00 01 25 25
            00 00 43 ED 00 06 00 40
            00 00 43 F0 00 01 05 05
